{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42325","headline":"和歙州陈使君见寄 · 徐铉","name":"和歙州陈使君见寄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"新安风景好，时令肃辕门。\n身贵心弥下，功多口不言。\n韬钤家法在，儒雅素风存。\n簪履陪游盛，乡闾俗化敦。\n临窗山色秀，绕郭水声喧。\n织络文章丽，矜严道义尊。\n楼台秋月静，京庾晚云屯。\n晓吹传衙鼓，晴阳展信旛。\n一篇贻友好，千里倍心论。\n未见归骖动，空能役梦魂。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐铉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42325.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42325","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}